<% content_for :title, "菌株图鉴 | 微生物培养皿领地游戏" %>

<div class="mb-6">
  <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-800 flex items-center gap-2">
    <span>🔬</span> 菌株图鉴
  </h1>
</div>

<div class="mb-8">
  <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-800 mb-4 pb-2 border-b border-slate-200">🎯 目标菌株（可选）</h2>
  <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
    <% @strains.each do |s| %>
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-5 shadow-sm border border-slate-100 hover:shadow-md transition">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center" style="background-color: <%= s.color %>20;">
            <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full" style="background-color: <%= s.color %>;"></span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-800"><%= s.name %></h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">菌株编号 #<%= s.id %></p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-2 text-sm">
          <div class="flex justify-between">
          <span class="text-slate-500">🌡️ 最适温度</span>
          <span class="font-semibold"><%= s.optimal_temp %>°C</span>
        </div>
          <div>
            <div class="flex justify-between text-xs text-slate-500 mb-1">耐受范围</div>
            <div class="w-full h-2 bg-slate-200 rounded-full overflow-hidden">
              <div class="h-full bg-orange-400" style="margin-left:<%= (s.temp_range[0]-10)/50.0*100 %>%;width:<%= (s.temp_range[1]-s.temp_range[0])/50.0*100 %>%;"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between text-xs text-slate-400 mt-0.5"><span><%= s.temp_range[0] %>°C</span><span><%= s.temp_range[1] %>°C</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex justify-between">
            <span class="text-slate-500">📈 基础生长率</span>
            <span class="font-semibold text-primary-600"><%= (s.growth_rate*100).round %>% /轮</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex justify-between">
            <span class="text-slate-500">⚗️ pH 范围</span>
            <span class="font-semibold"><%= s.ph_range[0] %> - <%= s.ph_range[1] %></span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    <% end %>
  </div>
</div>

<div>
  <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-800 mb-4 pb-2 border-b border-slate-200 text-danger-700">🦠 污染菌株（随机出现）</h2>
  <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
    <% @contaminants.each do |c| %>
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-5 shadow-sm border border-danger-100 hover:border-danger-300 transition">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center bg-danger-50 border border-danger-200">
            <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full" style="background-color: <%= c.color %>;"></span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-800"><%= c.name %></h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-danger-600">污染菌株 #<%= c.id %></p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-2 text-sm">
          <div class="flex justify-between">
            <span class="text-slate-500">🌡️ 最适温度</span>
            <span class="font-semibold"><%= c.optimal_temp %>°C</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="flex justify-between text-slate-500 mb-1">
              <span>⚔️ 竞争指数</span>
              <span class="font-bold text-danger-600"><%= (c.competitiveness*100).round %>%</span>
            </div>
            <div class="w-full h-2 bg-slate-200 rounded-full overflow-hidden">
              <div class="h-full bg-danger-500 transition-all" style="width:<%= c.competitiveness*100 %>%;"></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 p-2 bg-danger-50 rounded mt-3">
            💡 竞争力越高，越容易抢夺营养并入侵目标菌落
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    <% end %>
  </div>
</div>
